# Copy into the OMS repo as .github/CODEOWNERS and enable "Require review from Code Owners" in branch protection.
# Every path protected by gates/checks/protected_paths.py is listed here, so a `plumbline-policy-change` PR always
# needs a named human owner. Keep this file in sync with PROTECTED in protected_paths.py when either changes.
# Also restrict who can apply the `plumbline-policy-change` label: agent/bot tokens must not have triage rights. Replace the team handles with your own.

# CI, ownership, agent prompts and critic definitions
/.github/workflows/            @platform-governance
/.github/CODEOWNERS            @platform-governance
/.github/prompts/              @platform-governance
/.github/agents/               @platform-governance
/CODEOWNERS                    @platform-governance
/.claude/                      @platform-governance
/.plumbline/                  @platform-governance
/.github/copilot-instructions.md @platform-governance
/.github/instructions/         @platform-governance
**/AGENTS.md                   @platform-governance
**/.semgrepignore*             @platform-governance
**/.gitattributes              @platform-governance
/.semgrep.yml                  @platform-governance
/.semgrep/                     @platform-governance
**/.mvn/                       @platform-governance
**/maven.config                @platform-governance
**/jvm.config                  @platform-governance
**/settings.xml                @platform-governance
**/checkstyle*.xml             @platform-governance
**/pmd*.xml                    @platform-governance
**/spotbugs*.xml               @platform-governance
**/*suppressions*.xml          @platform-governance
**/lombok.config               @platform-governance
/security/tool-versions.env    @security-team

# Rulebooks
**/CLAUDE*.md                  @principal-architect
/services/*/CLAUDE*.md         @principal-architect @oms-tech-leads
/frontend/CLAUDE*.md           @principal-architect @frontend-lead

# Build/test configuration (coverage + test plugins live here)
**/pom.xml                     @platform-governance

# Regulated code paths
/services/order-service/src/main/java/**/service/OrderStateMachineService.java  @oms-architects
/services/risk-service/                                                           @risk-owners @oms-architects
/services/client-service/**/service/*Cash*                                        @client-owners @oms-architects
/services/*/src/main/resources/db/migration/                                      @dba-team
